TI  - Near total transection of the trachea following percutaneous dilatational 
      tracheostomy.
PG  - 242-3
AB  - The bedside procedure of percutaneous dilatational tracheostomy (PDT) in the 
      intensive care unit continues to gain popularity. Percutaneous dilatational 
      tracheostomy is recommended as simple, safe and cost-effective. The procedure can 
      be associated with serious life-threatening complications. We report a case of 
      near total transection of the trachea following PDT.
